        "id": "p1",
        "ja": "首相官邸に入る高市早苗首相＝首相官邸で2026年9月25日午前9時52分、平田明浩撮影",
        "en": "The Takaichi Cabinet approval rating rose to 45 percent, while disapproval fell to 40 percent. Approval surpassed disapproval for the first time in three months.",
